{
  "scope": "Invented data-only source-informed ASCII/UTF16-unit engine controls. No original interpreter/device executed. Formatting precedes command interpretation. Registers signed32; finite sufficient-capacity domain. Script strings are test INPUT DATA, not implementation code.",
